# cx — while `take(p)` passed the pointer. The `*` that starts the argument is parked (`_dro_want`: the
# pointer in a hidden temp, `_dlo_park`); when the dereference is the whole argument, nothing emitted since
# (`_dro_take`), the pointer is pushed — as `take(p)` pushes it, the callee copying a by-value parameter in
